s":"French, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0DdmKihJ90qKP5TAM3c2yQ","review_id":"f-8XY4g3JHEDxU0D0Wc9Mw","date":"2012-09-18T23:33:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9486348628997803,"text_excerpt":"This is definitely one of my new favorite spots for breakfast. The Pork Rillette is to die for, everything from the pickles to the onion jam is absolutely perfect. I also love the Salmon Rillette, it is so buttery and luscious it's hard to order anything else! Last time I went I tried to order the Baked Egg in Brioche but they were sadly all out, I will most definitely be trying it next time! I also love how homey this place is, from the cutsey little animal themed coffee creamers to the sunny yellow walls. Tartine is my kind of place."},{"business_id":"0DdmKihJ90qKP5TAM3c2yQ","review_id":"rqdNiqs5sA-EqH_Hy20rXA","date":"2013-03-02T22:28:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9335939884185791,"text_excerpt":"Absolutely LOVE this place! I came here for the first time for breakfast, because my sis had a groupon. Best decision of my life to wake up early for their food! My sister got the famous ham and cheese in brioche, and it was just UNBELIEVABLE! The brioche is just TO DIE FOR! Just thinking about it is making me drool...and I can't have some now because they're not open at night...poop. But I've also tried the pork rillette, and the quiche. The pork rillette was good, but I could never choose that over the quiche. The quiche was the best I've ever had, but I haven't tried many, so maybe that's not saying much. I would hold the quiche up to par with the eggs in brioche if it was a bit less s..."},{"business_id":"0DdmKihJ90qKP5TAM3c2yQ","review_id":"4YWtfqFRB1gMpAxzgL72Sw","date":"2019-08-02T11:56:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9325090646743774,"text_excerpt":"New Orleans, LA is known for great food with it's own mix of awesome flavors but we found a hidden jewel when we found Tartine. Tartine is a breakfast, brunch and lunch cafe, we went for lunch. My friend and I each ordered the House Smoked Turkey sandwich. Were we ever surprised when they arrived and were so large, we could have ordered one and split it and still had quite a feast. The sandwich was served with a bean slaw side that I could never get enough of. We also sampled a delicious home made scone and a brownie large enough for two, all were culinary delights I plan to visit Tartine as often as I can. I want to try every item on the menu I here that on Sundays they have Grits and Gr..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0DdmKihJ90qKP5TAM3c2yQ","photo_id":"nziwFyaDVhvPsRqqu1BuGg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nziwFyaDVhvPsRqqu1BuGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8966420888900757},{"business_id":"0DdmKihJ90qKP5TAM3c2yQ","photo_id":"AtShlKXaExVux7RQea9gAQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AtShlKXaExVux7RQea9gAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8709510564804077},{"business_id":"0DdmKihJ90qKP5TAM3c2yQ","photo_id":"Opuu19cNXQ5eYedP6Y6FOA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Opuu19cNXQ5eYedP6Y6FOA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8675515651702881},{"business_